{"title":"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be a triangle. The bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3ad57710b6810476e6017ea2c2cc6d41219c218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> intersects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and the bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/0728bebb477a2636300c56851b6a6f9e382c1b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> intersects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a9535592cb7aac018a9af8e68f6bc0815c4bee92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/f/f0f4eb40721d2d7f8b3125281443c8feecb50958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE=2$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/6/be6680a35b22c11c0ee9f16a760de124151579b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=3$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, then the perimeter of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> can be expressed in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc39f6ba583f6159aadcb898b5f7677688db8f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For simplicity, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2bed5de057bbd1b0e6e79522632261e788b716a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE=x$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/3/ef3af0915f32bced1d5fa2ba9bdf63c60fabfe42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />. By the angle bisector theorem, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/e/f0e8df09996054b4cbd514c4d1b8510edd8d99d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AB}{AE}=\\frac{BC}{CE}\\Longrightarrow\\frac{y+1}{x}=\\frac{3}{2}\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"37\" /> using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/2918f7d23f9ee8c04baabad86100d68023ec03f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> as the bisected angle. Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4056d41f42aa8a00adca0ff5d1209b6bb0e92d6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> as the bisected angle, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/6/b261c2136a9267ba7d9cfd6f4d617652e226a64e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AC}{AF}=\\frac{BC}{BF}\\Longrightarrow\\frac{x+2}{y}=3\\]\" width=\"205\" height=\"41\" />These two equations form a system of equations: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/8/d4842ef9ca4d22fd26eeb026a15aef8bdce0f26f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left\\{\\begin{matrix} 2y+2=3x \\\\ x+2=3y \\end{matrix}\\right.\\Longrightarrow x=\\frac{10}{7}, y=\\frac{8}{7}\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"43\" />\nTherefore, the perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc987c9c815a826d8f7ef8d880382e0f58820bb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+\\frac{10}{7}+\\frac{8}{7}=\\frac{60}{7}\\Longrightarrow\\boxed{067}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"278\" height=\"38\" />\\\\\n~bhargavakanakapura\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II\" title=\"2020 CIME II\">2020 CIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 CIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_II_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIME II Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CIME Problems and Solutions\"> All CIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:MAC_Notice&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:MAC Notice (page does not exist)\">Template:MAC Notice</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017203555\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 181/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1463/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 133/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion d